# NinaNatur auto-deploy — poll GHCR every minute and roll new images.
#
# Install in ROOT's crontab (sudo crontab -e), matching the other deploys on this
# host (battlefuel, funding-tender-tracker, 3dmap2). Do not use a user crontab —
# four deploys in three mechanisms is what makes the next debugging session hard.
#
# The `sleep 15` is not padding. Each project's auto-deploy.sh holds its own lock,
# which only protects it against itself; the offsets keep the deploys from all
# pulling from GHCR in the same second. Taken slots on this host:
#   :00  battlefuel     :30  funding-tender-tracker     :45  3dmap2
# NinaNatur takes :15.
#
# * * * * * sleep 15; cd /opt/ninanatur && /usr/bin/env bash deploy/auto-deploy.sh deploy/.env.prod >> /var/log/ninanatur-deploy.log 2>&1
# * * * * * sleep 15; cd /opt/ninanatur && /usr/bin/env bash deploy/auto-deploy.sh deploy/.env.dev  >> /var/log/ninanatur-deploy.log 2>&1
